window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>More monsters. More magic. More maidens.</b></p> <p>Tim Dent's adventures have brought him to the sea-faring realm known as Lagoon, where he's acquired more monsters in his bid to defeat Kyros, the First Summoner. However, his staunch ally Henry Flint, the captain of the ship known as the <i>Glen Carrig</i>, has been captured by Seiryu, a legendary monster of immense power.</p> <p>Together with his tamed monsters and his beautiful companions, Tim must rescue Flint before he's consumed.</p> <p><i>Narrated in duet style.</i></p>"; 
